        introduction='Eight identities retain eleven actual Core/book placements. Mental Prison and Mass Suggestion keep both school versions; Soul Cage keeps both distinct target scopes as an unchanged post-push receipt only. Seven mechanical source questions preserve printed target counts,control promises and save types without importing external spell implementations. Soul Cage the ordinary spell is not silently equated with the separate feat.',
